menu "Apple Clock"
    config AIRPLAY_APPLE_CLOCK_ASYM_US
        int "Path asymmetry correction (us)"
        default 0
        range -2000 2000
        help
            Added to the sender's time from both directions. Two-way PTP
            cannot see a difference between the two directions of the path;
            if a measurement against a HomePod (microphone, oscilloscope)
            shows a constant one, set it here. Positive: this receiver plays
            earlier.
endmenu
